 add('Horn & sound','manual-horn','Sound the manual horn','Sound is enabled in this scenario. Press/hold the horn; a quick tap gives a short blast. If silent, check device volume.','Press the manual HORN control',null,(s,e)=>e===K('horn')&&s.sound,['horn']);
